<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia TCV 2008 bond yields 7.7845 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia TCV 2008 bond yields 7.7845 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corp of Victoria</p>
<p>(TCV) said its tender of its 7.5 percent August 2008 stock</p>
<p>produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.7845 percent.</p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON    7.5 PCT    MATURITY  15.08.08</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	 7.7845     SETT DATE 04.02.97</p>
<p> ALLOTED 100 PCT	 RANGE     7.78-7.79</p>
<p>TCV is the central borrowing authority for the state of Victoria.</p>
</text>
